Description:It is your first main phase. You control Quilled Charger (4/3, saddle 2; whenever it attacks while saddled, it gets +1/+2 and menace) and Grizzly Bears, which came under your control this turn (summoning sick). The opponent is at 5 life and controls an untapped Wall of Stone (0/8). Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-saddle-summoning-sick | Saddle taps other creatures with total power N, at sorcery speed, and like crew it may tap a summoning-sick creature (CR 702.171a): saddle with the Bears, attack, and the Charger is a 5/5 with menace the lone Wall can't block
